11
01:08:03,750 --> 01:08:09,750
(also known as Superfast & Superfurious and sometimes marketed as Superfast 8) is a 2015
American action comedy film written and directed by Jason Friedberg and Aaron Seltzer.

12
01:14:15,000 --> 01:14:21,000
The film is a parody of the Fast & Furious film series.

13
01:20:26,250 --> 01:20:32,250
It was released in theaters and VOD on April 3, 2015, to
coincide with the premiere of Furious 7.

14
01:26:37,500 --> 01:26:43,500
The film explores themes of car race, parody, spoof.

15
01:32:48,750 --> 01:32:54,750
